				{
					"id": "NoRefineriesWithHarvesterSlotsAvailable",
					"text": "",
					"comment": "This one and MaxHarvesterLimitReached are once again the problem where this is the sum of multiple refineries having the MaxHarvesterLimitReached. Therefore, this is useful for AI whereas the singular one is not. How do we differentiate, or only keep the useful ones?\n\nThis means that either the AI has to pick a random Refinery and if it fails, return MaxHarvesterLimitReached and drive needs up and this one needs to be deleted, but this feels weird. Therefore, we need to find a way to make some Reasons AI-only.",
					"implemented": true,
					"props": {},
					"info": ""
				},
