					"props": {},
					"complexity": 0,
					"flags": 0,
					"title": "Duke",
					"desc": "Leto is the revered leader of House Atreides. A fair man respected for his wisdom and cunning, he is equally at ease in the Emperor's court as on a battlefield. He is well known for earning the trust and loyalty of his subjects rather than ruling over them by terror.",
