					"desc": "Ilesa is the second daughter of Armanda. Having barely survived an assassination attempt at the onset of adulthood, losing an arm and an eye in the process, Ilesa has grown into a bitter and serious woman, with no qualms about using her infirmity to guilt people into doing her bidding.",
