							"health": 40000
						}
					],
					"texts": {
						"desc": "A densely populated city, erected by the Harkonnens shortly after their arrival on Arrakis, and the headquarters of their forces. It was built quickly, with functionality and efficiency in mind rather than aesthetics or quality of life, which has led many observers to criticize its austere architecture and almost menacing silhouette.",
						"name": "Carthag",
						"plural": {
							"name": "Carthag"
						}
					}
				},
