							"health": 40000
						}
					],
					"texts": {
						"desc": "The home of Esmar Tuek and headquarters of his smuggling operations, Sietch Tuek looks remarkably welcoming and conspicuous, much like an open air bazaar. Indeed, while the activities conducted here are kept low key, the sietch doesn't try to keep itself hidden or out of sight, as it is has to be found easily by potential customers.",
						"name": "Sietch Tuek",
						"plural": {
							"name": "Sietch Tuek"
						}
