					"texts": {
						"desc": "Sietch Tabr is one of the bigger and more famous Fremen sietches on Arrakis. It is elusive to its enemies, as its closed architecture and secluded location make it hard to spot in the desert. While the Fremen are usually welcome, other visitors may receive a rather cold reception.",
