					"id": "ImpBase",
					"texts": {
						"desc": "Giant space lighters are used by Shaddam IV as mobile palaces and bases of operations. They are fully fitted to house the whole imperial court, communication apparatus able to reach the entire galaxy, and several legions of Sardaukar. While not as comfortable as the Imperial palace of Kaitain, these ships are still ostensibly luxurious.",
