						"plural": {
							"name": "Foliage"
						},
						"desc": "Leaving their home planet for Arrakis was a difficult journey for [Ecaz-longname]. Foliage was built as a reminder of the majesty and quiet of Ecaz forests. All of Ecazi craftmanship was deployed into its high arch and fine pillars of sculpted wood."
