					"texts": {
						"name": "S-Vault",
						"desc": "Ixians are used to living underground. Building a new city on Arrakis is simple for such an industrious and crafty people. The S-Vault was built the Ixian way, below surface with a focus on comfort and secrecy. It makes you wonder what they're making in there.",
