						"plural": {
							"name": "Experimental Ornithopters"
						},
						"desc": "The Ixians have used their craft to create this cutting-edge ornithopter. It flies faster, quieter, and farther than a traditionnal one, using only the power of the sun, a resource in abundance on Arrakis. It will be years before we can mass-product such a vehicle."
					},
