					"id": "F_Hero_1",
					"texts": {
						"name": "Chani",
						"desc": "Chani is a young Fremen mothered by the famous imperial planetologist Liet Kynes. A bold and charismatic woman and an adept fighter, she is loyal to her native people and is determined to do whatever it takes to remove any lingering Harkonnen presence from her planet.",
