				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "restrictedZones",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "traitChances",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Chance of traits appearing\n0=common\n1=rare\n2=exceptional"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "6:trait",
					"name": "zoneTraitOnRecon",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "6:resource",
					"name": "villageResourceOnGeneration",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "3",
					"name": "villageResourceProdQty",
					"opt": true
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "districtSlots",
					"opt": true
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "maximumRarities",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Maximum amount of traits of given rarities the entity can have. \n\nFor each list entry, \"maximum\" defines the max amount the entity can roll for the given rarities in \"rarities\". \nRarities attached to a maximum are linked, and so each roll of one of the rarities in the array will increment the counter. As such, a rarity might no longer be rollable even though it wasn't rolled, because other rarities in the array were rolled and reached the maximum. \n\nExample : rarities = [1, 2], maximum = 1 : \nIf a trait of rarity 2 gets selected, both rarity 1 and 2 will not be rollable again for the entity.\n\nIf the list has multiple entries, and multiple rarities are affected to distinct maximums(not recommended as it might have an effect on the desired maximums depending on random roll order) the highest possible maximum for a rarity will be taken into account.\n"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "aiWeight",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "upkeep",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "lootingValue",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "annexationTime",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Time to annex in days"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "liberationTime",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "pillagingTime",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "genStats",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "genBiomes",
					"opt": true
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
