					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "StickyFactionTarget: The raid will continue hitting the same faction when choosing new targets\nTargetClosest: Targets the closest target from the target faction upon new targetting\nOriginBasedOwner: The raid will be owned by the oiwner of its origin\nAssistOwner: The raid will siege with the owner faction instead of creating its own siege. It will also be disbanded if a truce is established between its owner and the target faction"
