					"documentation": "Keywords:\n- ::upgrade::, ::building::\n- ::development::\n\nAgents / Missions:\n- ::mission:: -> the mission name\n- [::faction::] -> the agent / mission faction\n- [::targetFaction::] -> the other faction\n- ::agent::\n- ::creatorFaction:: -> the agent first faction owner\n\nAbilities:\n- ::ability:: the ability name\n- [::faction::] the faction that launched the ability\n\nResource & Hegemony:\n- [::resource::] -> The resource\n- [::faction::] -> The faction concerned\n- ::value:: -> The concerned amount\n\nEntity & faction:\n- [::faction::] -> The owner or the faction itself\n- [::vname::] -> The name of the village or structure\n- ::region:: -> the region's name\n\nTrade:\n- [::faction::] -> The faction that sent/received the trade"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "1",
					"name": "gamepadDesc",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": "localizable"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "delay",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Delay before the alert shows on screen in seconds GAME TIME"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "repeatDelay",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Delay after dismissing an alert before it can show up again in seconds GAME TIME"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "lifetime",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "In seconds REAL TIME\nCan be ignored by the code if we override the value with a dynamic value"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "10:Locked,NoDisplay,Urgent,Pile,Blink,NoAction,NeverBlink,AutoPause,Wiggle,NoPileSound,Directional,Glow,AutoRemoveWithFocus",
					"name": "flags",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "NoPileSound: Will not play sound for subsequent alerts of the same pile\nAutoRemoveWithFocus: will remove itself if focus is removed"
				},
