					"name": "Photosensitive mode",
					"desc": "Removes flashes on:\n\n-Alerts\n-Movement commands\n-Tutorial highlights\n-Demo & Drones impact explosions\n-Menu icons (when waiting for an action)\n-Events UI icons\n-Capture flags\n-Negative traits\n-Inactive units UI icons\n-Drones Muzzle flash (Corrino & Fremen)\n-Atomics operation\n-Orbital Strike operation\n-Airships lights, muzzles, abilities, explosions (Death & Missiles)\n\n\nOther changes:\n\n-No lightnings in sandstorms\n-Alerts are way less shaky\n-Victory visual effects are less flashy\n-Removes Sardaukar hit effects"
