				{
					"id": "M4_02_SpiceSlider",
					"title": "Spice Slider",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "Harvested [Spice] is either immediately sold for [Solari] or stockpiled to pay the [$my(contract)].",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": ""
						},
						{
							"id": "M215",
							"text": "The slider on the top-left corner of the screen indicates how much [Spice] you sell to the CHOAM, and how much you stockpile.\n\nAs you can see, you are currently selling most of the [Spice] you harvest.",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "spiceDistSlider"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": ""
						},
						{
							"id": "M216",
							"text": "If you drag the slider up or down, it changes the ratio of [Spice] sold.\n\nTo pay the [$my(contract)] in time, you should raise the Spice slider to stockpile [Spice] faster.",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
