					}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_01_Start",
					"title": "The Landsraad Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "Good morning, my lord.\nYou asked for a refresher on everything a proud leader needs to protect his standing within the Faufreluches.\nLet's begin today, with a few reminders on the [LandsraadCouncil].",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nFaufreluches is a book term"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_01_Intro",
					"title": "The Landsraad Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "We'll have a few mock councils today, but first let's look at our political capability.\n\nOn the right side of the screen, below the [LandsraadCouncil] button are two precious resources: [Influence] and [CouncilVote]",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"className": "tutorial-landsraad-resources"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"padText": "We'll have a few mock councils today, but first let's look at our political capability.\n\nOn the right side of the screen, below the [LandsraadCouncil] icon are two precious resources: [Influence] and [CouncilVote]"
						},
						{
							"id": "M215",
							"text": "[CouncilVote]s are our direct political power. When the [LandsraadCouncil] is in session, we can use that amount of votes. Not doing so would be a waste.\n\nIt's technically possible to increase the amount of [CouncilVote]s but most of the time, it will remain at 100.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "CouncilVote"
							},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M216",
							"text": "[Influence] is much more versatile, but also less permanent.\n\nLike [CouncilVote]s, we can use it on resolutions to increase their vote total, but unlike [CouncilVote]s, [Influence] used that way is lost.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Influence"
							},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "[Influence] is also used for most diplomatic actions.\n\nAs we are constantly producing more [Influence], you should not hesitate to use it.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Influence"
							},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilOpening",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "Let's start our first mock council.",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilPause",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "This is the [LandsraadCouncil]. While the council is in progress, the game is paused.",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilResource",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "On the right side, you can see the [CouncilVote]s and [Influence] of every faction.\n\nThe bars represent the total power of a faction for this council, [CouncilVote]s and [Influence] combined.",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"className": "tutorial-members"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M214",
							"text": "You can also see the [MinorHouses]' [CouncilVote]s.\n\nThe [MinorHouses] have little interest in Arrakis and are rarely in agreement with each other. It's hard to predict how they will vote.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"className": "tutorial-minor-houses"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilResAndScope",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "In the middle of the screen are the three resolutions under examination during this council: [InfrastructureValidations], [VehicleRegulation], and [SurveillanceCommittee].",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "",
											"className": "session-body"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M215",
							"text": "Each resolution can be of two scopes: it either affects everybody equally, like [SurveillanceCommittee], or it only targets one faction, like the other two.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "",
											"className": "tutorial-scope"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M216",
							"text": "All three resolutions are examinated at the same time. It means that you have to allocate your [CouncilVote]s intelligently.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "Some prefer to put all their [CouncilVote]s on a single resolution, while others distribute them between the three for a more diffuse impact.",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {},
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilVoteNow",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "Now, let's vote. For each resolution, choose the outcome you prefer and increase the vote count, until you've used all your [CouncilVote]s.",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"className": "tutorial-votes"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"padText": "Now, let's vote. For each resolution, choose the outcome you prefer with [Menu_LeftClick] and increase the vote count with [CycleSelect_Increase], until you've used all your [CouncilVote]s.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 772,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilVoteMore",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "If you keep increasing the vote count, it will use [Influence] instead, and the count will be blue. Click on the Confirm button whenever you are happy with your votes.",
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "readyButton"
										},
										{
											"id": "valueBtn",
											"className": "",
											"objectName": "element"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"padText": "If you keep increasing the vote count, it will use [Influence] instead, and the count will be blue. Go to the Confirm button and press [Menu_LeftClick] whenever you are happy with your votes.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 772,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilResults",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "Voting is over, sir! You can see how many votes each proposition has received. Hover on results to get the details of where the votes come from.",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"padText": "Voting is over! You can see how many votes each proposition has received. Go over the results to get the details of where the votes come from."
						},
						{
							"id": "M214",
							"text": "Each resolution that was approved will apply its effects immediately, and until the next council in 20 days.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_02_FirstCouncilEnding",
					"title": "First Council",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "The council is now over. You can unpause and close the window.",
							"highlight": {},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"padText": "The council is now over. You can close the window with [Menu_Back] and unpause."
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 261,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_StandingExplanation",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M213",
							"text": "The third important political resource is [Standing]. It represents how much the whole Landsraad community appreciates you.",
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Standing"
							},
							"overrides": [],
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat"
						},
						{
							"id": "M214",
							"text": "A [Standing_High] will give you many bonuses, while a [Standing_Low] will hurt your success in the politics.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Standing"
							}
						},
						{
							"id": "M216",
							"text": "[Standing] can raise slowly over time, mostly through alliances. But it can decrease abruptly if you betray an ally.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Standing"
							}
						},
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "[Standing] can bring many advantages. And having a high [Standing] makes you eligible to [Charter]s.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"resource": "Standing"
							}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterOpenWindow",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "Click on the [Landsraad] button, and let's go look at the [Charter]s.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"rightBar": 4
							}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 5,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterOpenWindow_Gamepad",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "Let's go look at the [Charter]s. To open the [Landsraad] outside of a council, open the menu navigation wheel by pressing [OpenMainWheel], then choose the [LandsraadWindow] option.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 5,
					"props": {
						"position": 2
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterShow",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "At the top of the [LandsraadCouncil] you can see the 5 [Charter]s.\n\nEach [Charter] is a powerful position within the [LandsraadCouncil] that you can get elected to.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"className": "tutorial-charters"
										}
									]
								}
							}
						},
						{
							"id": "M218",
							"text": "Set your cursor on a [Charter] to see both its effect and the prerequisites to become a candidate.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						},
						{
							"id": "M219",
							"text": "As you can see, [Corrino-longname] is already eligible to two [Charter]s.\n\nWe need to catch up.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"objectName": "charter-faction"
										}
									]
								}
							}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 3
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterCheat",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "I'll give you enough [Standing] and make you eligible to [CouncilSpeaker], so we can proceed.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 3
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterPriorityExplanation",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "Now, you can be elected to the [CouncilSpeaker] [Charter], but the subject still needs to be on the council agenda if you want to have a chance to get elected.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						},
						{
							"id": "M218",
							"text": "For a [Charter] to appear on the ballot, it needs to have at least ::value(Landsraad_MinimumCharterInvestment):: [AgendaPriority] and to have the most [AgendaPriority].",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "currentInvested"
										}
									]
								}
							}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 3
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterPriorityRaise",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "To raise [AgendaPriority] for [CouncilSpeaker] above ::value(Landsraad_MinimumCharterInvestment)::, you can spend [Influence] by clicking on the Support button.\n\nThe earlier you support a [Charter] after a [LandsraadCouncil] the more it increases its priority. Don't wait too long.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {
								"ui": {
									"match": [
										{
											"id": "addInvestmentButton",
											"className": "councilspeaker"
										}
									]
								}
							},
							"padText": "To raise [AgendaPriority] for [CouncilSpeaker] above ::value(Landsraad_MinimumCharterInvestment)::, you can spend [Influence] by pressing [Menu_LeftClick] on the Support button.\n\nThe earlier you support a [Charter] after a [LandsraadCouncil] the more it increases its priority. Don't wait too long."
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 773,
					"props": {
						"position": 3
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterPriorityConclusion",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "Now that you have raised its [AgendaPriority] above ::value(Landsraad_MinimumCharterInvestment)::, [CouncilSpeaker] will be examined in the agenda of the next [LandsraadCouncil]",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
							"overrides": [],
							"highlight": {}
						}
					],
					"speakers": [
						{
							"character": "Thufir"
						}
					],
					"flags": 768,
					"props": {
						"position": 3
					},
					"trigger": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "M6_03_CharterPriorityConclusionAlt",
					"title": "Standing and Charters",
					"mainText": "",
					"popupPages": [
						{
							"id": "M217",
							"text": "You were supposed to raise [CouncilSpeaker] priority, but if you think it's better this way, so be it.",
							"notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
