							"text": "To demolish a [!Building_Village]:\nSelect the [!Building_Village], open the selected [!Village] wheel by pressing [OpenSelectionWheel] and choose the Demolish Building option.\n\nRemember: [DewCollector]s are producing and not consuming [Water]. You should not demolish them.\n\nDemolish enough [!Building_Village]s to have 25 [Water].",
