		{
			"name": "speech",
			"columns": [
				{
					"typeStr": "0",
					"name": "id",
					"kind": null,
					"scope": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "speechesPerSpeaker"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "5:MySpeaker,TerritoryOwnerSpeaker,RandomSpeaker",
					"name": "from"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "10:OncePerConquest,CurrentVariation",
					"name": "flags",
					"kind": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "17",
					"name": "props",
					"kind": null
				}
			],
			"lines": [
				{
					"id": "FirstMissions_Start",
					"from": 0,
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Conquering Arrakis will mean fighting for the smallest patch of land, the tiniest grain of sand, the slightest mote of dust. Any stretch of territory counts when you must corner the enemy and crush them.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Extendyourgrasp_Piter_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\n\"territory\" is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, sinister, sombre, can insist on \"crush\""
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Without House Harkonnen to <i>squeeze</i> them, the villages of Arrakis are purposeless. Only you, Baron, know best how to profit from this planet.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Extendyourgrasp_Piter_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nsqueeze is a specific book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, sinister on the first sentence, can be a bit onctuous on the last sentence (we could hear that the Baron and Piter share a common cruelty)"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The villages have barely had time to rejoice. They had barely started celebrating your departure from Arrakis, and here you are again.\nI can't wait to see the terror on their faces when they see the Harkonnen army slaughtering their militias.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Extendyourgrasp_Piter_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nmilitia is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious but he is also mocking the Baron (maybe  smiling a bit).\nLast sentence: cruel, calm, like a predator"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "No doubt, those wretched clod villages will be dazzled by the sheer splendor of our House. I have a feeling that once subdued, they will come to rely on our blessings.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Extendyourgrasp_Sanya_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit despising, confident, arrogant "
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I fear we will need to resort to violence to subdue the villages of Arrakis. Considering the locals lived under the Harkonnens' yoke for decades, they'll greatly distrust any foreign House.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Extendyourgrasp_Sanya_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, calm, focused"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Our people can't harness the resources of Arrakis as well as the locals would. We need a workforce, which is qualified and accustomed to this wretched climate – the laborers of these villages will suffice.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Extendyourgrasp_Sanya_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: despising and determined (about to invade innocent villages to find manpower)"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The more territory you hold, the more you deprive your enemies of resources. No House, however powerful, can rely solely on outside support. We'll need to seize as much land as possible from the enemy.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Extendyourgrasp_Thufir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\n\"your enemies\" is neutral and do not refer to anyone specific",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, serious"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "My lord, this territory is of strategic importance in the conquest of Arrakis. We can use its resources to sustain the troops' efforts. We must make the most of the smallest patch of land.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Extendyourgrasp_Thufir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\n\"territory\" is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, serious, convinced that this territory would be helpful"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Based on the scouts' reports, this territory could serve as a rear base for our troops. Securing our progress on Arrakis is crucial. We must capture it.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Extendyourgrasp_Thufir_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nterritory is a specitif game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, serious"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Harkonnens oppressed the folk of pan and graben when they held Arrakis. By comparison, any other ruling power would seem preferable to them. Once we control their villages, they will follow you out of fear of falling into the hands of a House crueler than yours.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Extendyourgrasp_Hasimir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nfolk of pan and graben is a specific book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, neutral, polite and serious. We can feel that Fenring is despising toward the Harkonnen."
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Majesty, this territory is dotted with villages, which will be quick to challenge your authority. My advice is to deploy your troops there before they fall under your rivals' influence.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Extendyourgrasp_Hasimir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nFenring specifically says \"Majesty\", not \"Your Majesty\"\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, neutral, polite and serious. Killing villagers is not important."
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "This territory is equally rich in manpower and resources. Occupying these villages should stabilize our supply lines in the continuing conquest of Arrakis. This was a wise choice on your part.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Extendyourgrasp_Hasimir_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nFenring specifically says \"Majesty\", not \"Your Majesty\"\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, neutral, polite and serious. "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "You cannot let this territory be seized by any other House than our own. Our army needs these resources – the spaceships cannot supply us forever.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm but firm",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Firstmission_Tessia_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "These villages will not welcome us with open arms. All they know of the Imperium is the Harkonnens’ domination. But when they see the care with which you treat your people, they will rally your cause. Have no fear, my love – I know you will garner their loyalty.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm and then, more and more confident and gentle (she is speaking to her dear husband). She clearly believes what she is saying",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Firstmission_Tessia_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Don’t let the hostility of the people of Arrakis wear you down. They’ll fight back against our drones, to be sure, but once their villages are ours, they will benefit from the finest in Ixian technology. And once they’re used to all the advantages House Vernius offers, they’ll wonder how they ever lived without us.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm and determined, maybe smiling at the end of the sentence.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Firstmission_Tessia_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "These villages have never been a great source of revenue, but our contacts there are invaluable. Without a support base, the Smugglers won't be able to develop their operations enough to compete with the Great Houses.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, calm, maybe jalous or defiant when talking about the Great Houses.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Extendyourgrasp_Staban_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "It seems that one of your opponents has their eye on these villages and the nearby resources. Ah! It reminds me of the Harkonnens' rule over Arrakis. Why must these outsiders make trade so complicated?",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: despising and casual, upset/bored: fighting against those Great House is not a big deal",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Extendyourgrasp_Staban_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "We put in decades of effort to establish contacts in every village in this territory, and these outsiders are about to wipe it all out. We must stay in control, Father, or the Smugglers won't amount to more than a bunch of flea-bitten market vendors. Our family deserves better !",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: upset than the foreign people thread to wipe out their hard work. Then, very determined, ready to fight",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Extendyourgrasp_Staban_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The folk of the pan and graben will not withstand the offworlders' assault for long. If their villages fall, their numbers will strengthen our enemies. We must help them before that happens.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar\nfolk of pan and graben is a book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: deadly serious, concerned",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Extendyourgrasp_Stilgar_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "We cannot rely on the men of the cities, sister. They have Fremen blood, but they have forgotten how to live in the desert. In their time, they submitted to the Harkonnens. If we don't support them now, the folk of the pan and graben will once again serve the offworlders' ambitions.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar\n\nfolk of pan and graben is a book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit sad/regretful the city men are not true fremen. Serious",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Extendyourgrasp_Stilgar_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The cielagos have returned to the sietch! The offworlders have established their bases in this territory!\nThose wormfaced scum must already think they're the great lords of the desert. Let's prove them wrong, sister!",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: alerting Liet, then upset, aggressive and determined\nCielagos : Furry bats of Arrakis trained for communication by the Fremen.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Extendyourgrasp_Stilgar_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "GenericMissions_Start",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "House Harkonnen aren't the only ones taking an interest in this territory! So many souls eager to die of thirst in an endless desert...\nNo one knows Arrakis as well as you do. Your men have already colonized these lands, and they'll be up to the challenge again.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Generic_Piter_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit amused at first, even dreamy or lyrical\nThen, serious and determined, even a bit onctuous"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Why is your heart set on this territory, Baron? It's as dusty and dry as the others. Do you intend to use it as a rear base? As a bridge to more appealing land? Or is it the resources described in the latest reports?",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Generic_Piter_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: surprised, despising, amused"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "According to our spies, your enemies have already taken up position in this territory. We've also detected a few Fremen and some resources, which would aid your progress. Needless to say, every territory counts towards conquering Arrakis. As you well know.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Generic_Piter_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious and neutral, then a bit ironic, taunting the Baron"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I regret to inform you we're not alone in eyeing this territory. Our scouts have spotted enemy installations, which will deploy if we let them. You must thwart them, Mother.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Generic_Sanya_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, determined"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I find a certain beauty in this territory. These deserts aren't as dull as the filmbooks suggested. I bet it will inspire many artists when our House takes it.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Generic_Sanya_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nfilmbooks is a specific book term\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: thinking, calm"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "This territory seems ideal for our expansion, Mother. Beneath all that sand are the resources we need to continue our conquest of Arrakis and drive out our rivals.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Generic_Sanya_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm, determined"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "None of your rivals have captured this territory, but our agents say they've taken up position there. We must ensure that the locals submit to the Atreides' authority rather than your enemies'.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Generic_Thufir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nterritory is a specific game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, determined"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Judging by the information taken from the Harkonnens, this territory contains more resources than meets the eye. The same reports also mention a number of villages, which might cause trouble. Should we try to placate them through diplomatic means?",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Generic_Thufir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, determined, respectful"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I reviewed the reports the Harkonnens sent to the Spacing Guild before they left. They reveal that this territory was harvested up to the last minute – we should find resources there that would prove valuable in the conquest of Arrakis.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Generic_Thufir_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nSpacing Guild is a specific book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, serious then determined "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "None of the Great Houses have yet claimed this territory, but it won't be long now. Our scouts report that your rivals have set up outposts there. They need to be shown the superiority of the Empire.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Generic_Hasimir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm and respectful"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Reports prepared by Kynes described this territory as arid and of little use. Recent expeditions, however, indicate the presence of many deposits. I wonder what kind of game your planetologist was playing…",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Generic_Hasimir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: facual at first then thinking then doubting or defiant twoard Kynes"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Your enemies' presence in this territory points to its strategic importance. The Empire can ill afford to backtrack in the face of the Great Houses of the Landsraad – you have no choice but to capture these lands.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Generic_Hasimir_3_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm, serious"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "With this territory’s resources, we can establish our dominance over Arrakis and support our army. Your rivals will soon be forced to give up and accept defeat.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: confident",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Genericmission_Tessia_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The analytic machines have selected this territory as among the most strategic to our goals. Its location, its resources, its villages… everything about these lands makes them a perfect fit for our needs. We must not let them fall into our enemies’ hands.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm as she was reading a report, then determined and firm on the last sentence",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Genericmission_Tessia_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Your enemies already have a foothold in this territory, but no matter. You will have no trouble conquering it before them. No one knows how to exploit Arrakis more effectively than we do. With the technology of House Vernius at our disposal, our victory is assured.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined and confident. She is not angry about their enemies, she knows that her husband can defeat them.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Genericmission_Tessia_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Such ambition! Your rivals think they can take possession of this territory! They know virtually nothing of the desert, yet they're certain they can conquer it! Ha!\nNot only can we capture it before them, we can harvest it a hundred times more efficiently!",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: despising",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Generic_Staban_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Smugglers must increase their influence if they hope to compete with the Great Houses. We must tighten our grip on Arrakis! This territory's resources would give us a head start.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Generic_Staban_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I have learned from your instruction, Father. I am well aware that corruption is an expensive enterprise, in terms of both men and solari, which is why I recommend that you seize this territory. We could use its resources to recruit new spies and add to the bribes we can offer.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm and serious, trying to appear more obedient and mature than he is.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Generic_Staban_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The offworlders hope to find here the resources they need to conquer Dune. Their ‘thopters are already searching the desert for the slightest trace of spice. The Fremen must not let them advance any further.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, then determined and solemn",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Generic_Stilgar_1_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The more territories your enemies have, the harder it will be to stop them. Take care that they don't seize this one, for its resources are rich and its villages prosperous.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm, teaching Liet ",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Generic_Stilgar_2_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The tribes must be able to move about freely. When forced to avoid your enemies' territories, our warriors waste time and water. This one must not fall into their hands.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Generic_Stilgar_3_0"
										}
									],
									"target": 0
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "Bailout_Start",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Your conquest of Arrakis could be more profitable than we think. If the reports on this territory are accurate, it could allow you to invest in the CHOAM. The influence to be garnered by House Harkonnen would be most valuable.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Bailout_Piter_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit surprise, as if he was reading a new report. More deep, serious even Machiavellian/scheming on the last sentence"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "As expected, the spice war is destabilizing the CHOAM. It would be a shame not to take advantage of this, Baron. Buying shares at a low cost would strengthen House Harkonnen's influence in the Imperium.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Bailout_Piter_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: casual on the first sentence, then smiling, amused."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The conquest of Arrakis has had entertaining effects on our merchant friends – it would seem that the CHOAM is about to collapse. It's the perfect time to buy the Houses Minor's shares on the cheap.\nWe would prepare a future directorship and demonstrate our strength to our rivals.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Bailout_Sanya_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term\ndirectorship is a book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: amused, casual. Then serious, arrogant"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The entertainment offered by our conquest is not to everyone's liking – the Houses Minor seemed especially ill at ease. According to our contacts at the CHOAM, they're desperate to get rid of their shares. Let's seize the opportunity to buy them at a good price.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Bailout_Sanya_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term\nHouse minor is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: despising, amused then determined and motivated on the last sentence."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The conquest of Arrakis is disrupting the spice trade, and the CHOAM along with it. The Houses Minor are panicking – and therefore liable to sell their shares to the highest bidder.\nMy lord, I would suggest buying them before it falls into your enemies' hands.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Bailout_Thufir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term\nHouse minor is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, factual, even a bit concerned. Then serious and determined"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The CHOAM's status is worrisome, sire, but I also see an opportunity. Were you to buy enough shares, your enemies would be less inclined to attack you. They wouldn't be able to sell their spice without your consent.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Bailout_Thufir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nshares is a game term\nHouse minor is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, worried then serious and determined"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The CHOAM is struggling. Should the organization collapse, your Empire's balance will be threatened. Majesty, we have no choice but to support it. The flow of Solaris from your end will reassure the merchants that your conquest of Arrakis is proceeding smoothly.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Bailout_Hasimir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nCHOAM is a book and game term\nsolari is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, factual"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Houses Minor are in a panic. They're all trying to sell their shares in the CHOAM en masse. The shares must be bought – it's the only way to reassure the market in the Imperium that your conquest is going well. If it collapses, Arrakis would be the last of your worries.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Bailout_Hasimir_2_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nCHOAM is a book and game term\n\nHouse minor is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, factual"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Houses Minor seem to believe that the spice war will destroy the CHOAM. We must prove them wrong! Let us buy their shares with the resources acquired on Arrakis. Their fears will be swept aside, and your rivals will be put on notice.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: she can be a bit upset, as if the behavior of the House Minor was irrationnel but then, she appears confident and more and more casual.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Bailout_Tessia_1_0"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I did not expect the CHOAM to suffer the effects of this war so quickly…\nMy husband, we must not allow the Imperium's economy to collapse because of the conquest of Arrakis. We must use this territory's wealth to support it.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: at first, she is thinking, almost smiling (as if she has predicted Minor Houses' behavior). Then soft and gentle but determined (she has found the solution and just waits to apply it).",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Bailout_Tessia_2_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "You have taught me to listen for rumors, Father. Allow me to tell you of one that has piqued my interest.\nIn a recent transaction, one of our merchants noticed that a man he was dealing with appeared quite agitated. This representative of a House Minor informed the merchant that his lord is trying to sell his CHOAM shares by any means necessary. And it seems he's not the only one.\nIf the Company is really in trouble, no one will challenge our acquiring an interest in it. Could this be the opportunity we've been waiting for?",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: neutral, telling a story, then serious when saying \"he is not the only one\".\nCasual (even smiling?) on the last sentence",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Bailout_Staban_1_0"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The effects of the spice war are beginning to spread throughout the Empire. According to our spies, it's now CHOAM's turn to suffer the consequence. The value of its shares has plummeted in recent days, and the Houses Minor are rushing to sell.\nDo you think it would be advisable to acquire an interest in the Company? We won't have many chances like this one.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, explaining",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Bailout_Staban_2_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Our contacts amongst the smugglers are in a panic. They say it's related to something those thieves call CHOAM. Some have mentioned buying <i>shares</i>. Great gods! Have you any idea what they mean?",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: thinking at first, as if he was reading a report. Then, hesistate on the word \"share\". A bit puzzled (or overwhelmed) on the last two sentences ",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Bailout_Stilgar_1_0"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"variationIndex": 1,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Guild and CHOAM, the Great Houses and the Faufreluches, all these things the offworlders are obsessed with… You understand them better than we do, Liet. If these <i>shares</i> can help the tribes liberate Dune, then the Fremen must acquire some.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Stilgar",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: fatalistic, resigned.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Bailout_Stilgar_2_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "Agony_Start",
					"from": 0,
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The latest reports are worrying, Baron. The enemy is preparing to launch a massive assault on this position, and their army has already reached the border.\nYour rear bases have been warned, but I'm sorry to say that troops are moving too slowly. This territory's defense depends on you alone.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Agony_Piter_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a game term\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, worried but not panicking. Could speak quicker than usual. Deep and sombre on the last sentence"
										},
										{
											"text": "The latest reports are worrying, Baron. The enemy is preparing to launch a massive assault on this position, and their army has already reached the border.\nYour rear bases have been warned, but I'm sorry to say that troops are moving too slowly. This territory's defense depends on you alone.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Agony_Piter_1f_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a game term\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, worried but not panicking. Could speak quicker than usual. Deep and sombre on the last sentence"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Mother! Our hold on this territory is compromised. We haven't heard from our scouts since they reached the border. I fear they've been intercepted… An enemy attack seems imminent.\r\nI'm attempting to contact our rear bases to get reinforcements, but I urge you to defend this territory. Our troops may not make it in time.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1_0",
											"targetMatch": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a game term\n\"Ecazis\" are people from planet Ecaz, it's a book term\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, tense, serious"
										},
										{
											"text": "Mother! Our hold on this territory is compromised. We haven't heard from our scouts since they reached the border. I fear they've been intercepted… An enemy attack seems imminent.\r\nI'm attempting to contact our rear bases to get reinforcements, but I urge you to defend this territory. Our troops may not make it in time.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1f_0",
											"targetMatch": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a game term\n\"Ecazis\" are people from planet Ecaz, it's a book term\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, tense, serious"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Our scouts report enemy troops amassing at the border. The assault could begin any moment!\nYour reserve troops are too far away – they won't get to us in time. We must hold out until they arrive!",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Agony_Thufir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious, worried, even angry toward the enemy. Very determined to fight on the last sentence"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Our agents are clear: The enemy is about to launch an assault. I don't know why a Great House would attack you directly, but it seems they've been preparing for this for some time. Unlike us.\nYour reserve troops most likely won't arrive in time to defend this position. We're alone against our opponent, Majesty.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Agony_Hasimir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nHasimir specifically say \"Majesty\" and not \"Your majesty\"\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, factual, then despising about the \"Great House\", he is angry toward this traitor. Then factual, serious and sombre."
										},
										{
											"text": "Our agents are clear: The enemy is about to launch an assault. I don't know why a Great House would attack you directly, but it seems they've been preparing for this for some time. Unlike us.\nYour reserve troops most likely won't arrive in time to defend this position. We're alone against our opponent, Majesty.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Agony_Hasimir_1f_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nHasimir specifically say \"Majesty\" and not \"Your majesty\"\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: concerned, factual, then despising about the \"Great House\", he is angry toward this traitor. Then factual, serious and sombre."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "We’ve intercepted an enemy message…\nYour rival is preparing to attack this territory! His army is already on the march. My love, you must be ready to use every tool at your disposal to buy time until reinforcements arrive. This territory is ours. We won’t let anyone take it from us.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit affraid or preoccupied and then more calm but determined",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Agony_Tessia_1_0"
										},
										{
											"text": "We’ve intercepted an enemy message…\r\nYour rival is preparing to attack this territory! Her army is already on the march. My love, you must be ready to use every tool at your disposal to buy time until reinforcements arrive. This territory is ours. We won’t let anyone take it from us.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: a bit affraid or preoccupied and then more calm but determined",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Agony_Tessia_1f_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Father! I have catastrophic news! The enemy is upon us!\nOur spies have seen hundreds of their men massing at the border! They're mounting an assault!\nWe must defend ourselves. I've already contacted our allies in the other territories, but I don't know how long they'll take to reach us. Without them, we can only rely on ourselves!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban\n\n\"The enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: scared, about to panic",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Agony_Staban_1_0"
										},
										{
											"text": "Father! I have catastrophic news! The enemy is upon us!\nOur spies have seen hundreds of their men massing at the border! They're mounting an assault!\nWe must defend ourselves. I've already contacted our allies in the other territories, but I don't know how long they'll take to reach us. Without them, we can only rely on ourselves!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban\n\n\"The enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: scared, about to panic",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Agony_Staban_1f_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "Agony_Step1",
					"from": 0,
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The assault is imminent. And it seems even worse than what our intelligence conveyed.\nWithout reinforcements, we can expect a massacre.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Agony_Piter_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: serious. Then a bit casual when talking about the \"massacre\""
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "With or without reinforcements, the Ecazis are fighting and dying with great panache.\nThis territory is ours, and we fought hard to seize it. Handing it over to the enemy is out of the question. Know I shall stay by your side as long as it takes.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a game term\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined to fight, brave and proud as a knight "
										},
										{
											"text": "With or without reinforcements, the Ecazis are fighting and dying with great panache.\nThis territory is ours, and we fought hard to seize it. Handing it over to the enemy is out of the question. Know I shall stay by your side as long as it takes.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1f_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nterritory is a game term\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined to fight, brave and proud as a knight "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I have alarming news, my lord. Our spies confirm that the enemy attack is imminent, and our reinforcements are nowhere to be seen. We'll have to hold out as long as we can, and hope that your men will get here in time to save us.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Agony_Thufir_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: tired, sad"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The enemy has crossed the border, Majesty.\nYour opponent is cunning – He's planned multiple waves to wear down your forces. We must be cautious to hold out until reinforcements arrive.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Agony_Hasimir_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nHasimir specifically say \"Majesty\" and not \"Your majesty\"\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, serious, then more factual, as he was planning something"
										},
										{
											"text": "The enemy has crossed the border, Majesty.\nYour opponent is cunning – She's planned multiple waves to wear down your forces. We must be cautious to hold out until reinforcements arrive.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Agony_Hasimir_1f_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nHasimir specifically say \"Majesty\" and not \"Your majesty\"\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, serious, then more factual, as he was planning something"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The enemy is upon us. His troops have reached our border, and their numbers are impressive. But we will prevail. Our defenses are strong, and we are prepared to protect our villages. They will not fall. Our reinforcements will have time to reach us.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, firm when she says \"But we will prevail\"",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Agony_Tessia_1_1"
										},
										{
											"text": "The enemy is upon us. Her troops have reached our borders, and their numbers are impressive. But we will prevail. Our defenses are solid, and we are prepared to protect our villages. They will not fall. Our reinforcements will have time to reach us.",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, firm when she says \"But we will prevail\"",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Agony_Tessia_1f_1"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The enemy is attacking!\nFather! We must hold strong as long as we can. Our allies are still too far away to be of any help!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban\n\n\"The enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: scared, trying to stay calm (but failing)",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Agony_Staban_1_1"
										},
										{
											"text": "The enemy is attacking!\nFather! We must hold strong as long as we can. Our allies are still too far away to be of any help!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban\n\n\"The enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: scared, trying to stay calm (but failing)",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Agony_Staban_1f_1"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "Agony_Step2",
					"from": 0,
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The reinforcements have arrived, Baron!\nDisregard their exhaustion! They must fight for House Harkonnen. Your hold on this territory depends on it.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Agony_Piter_1_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nterritory is a game term\n",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: aggressive, determined to revenge "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Mother! The reinforcements have arrived!\nWe'll avenge the affront done to you! Your enemy will regret ever attacking House Ecaz!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: proud, fierce, determined to revenge "
										},
										{
											"text": "Mother! The reinforcements have arrived!\nWe'll avenge the affront done to you! Your enemy will regret ever attacking House Ecaz!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Agony_Sanya_1f_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: proud, fierce, determined to revenge "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 2,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "My lord! Our reinforcements have arrived! They await your orders!\nIt's time to make the enemy regret attacking the Atreides!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 0
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Agony_Thufir_1_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nhere \"the enemy\" is masculine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: eager to fight, determined, proud"
										},
										{
											"text": "My lord! Our reinforcements have arrived! They await your orders!\nIt's time to make the enemy regret attacking the Atreides!",
											"match": {
												"gender": 1
											},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Agony_Thufir_1f_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nhere \"the enemy\" is feminine",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: eager to fight, determined, proud"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Majesty, our reinforcements have arrived.\nYour men are ready to avenge this affront to the Empire.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Agony_Hasimir_1_2",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nHasimir specifically say \"Majesty\" and not \"Your majesty\"\n",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: calm, factual but the player can hear that he is determined to revenge (but not too obvious, Fenring has a deep control on his feelings and emotions."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Reinforcements incoming!\nOur troops have arrived! Let us drive these wretches from our lands! You need only give the order!",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: triumphant, hopeful",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Agony_Tessia_1_2"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Our men! Our men have reached the territory! They're awaiting your orders!\nGreat gods, at last! We can now counterattack.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: crying he has just seen the reinforcements on his radar. Hopeful/relieved on the last sentence",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Agony_Staban_1_2"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "AncientSietch_Start",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The number of Fremen in this territory is unanticipated. To be honest, it contradicts our most generous estimates of their population throughout Arrakis. Have they regrouped here for some reason, or were we somewhat optimistic about the threat they represent?\nI must advise you to take an interest in the region's sietches. House Harkonnen won't be undermined by some Fremen.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Ancientsietch_Piter_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nSietch is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: genuinely surprised, intrigued, thinking.\nOn the second paragraph, he is serious, even a bit concerned. Considers Fremen like wild animals."
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "What were the Harkonnens basing their reports to the Imperium on? The Fremen population here is higher than their estimates for the planet! It seems like they never looked up from their harvester tracks.\r\nThe Ecazis aren't cut from the same cloth, right, Mother? We must use this territory to contact the sietches, and learn more about those desert creatures.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Ancientsietch_Sanya_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nEcazis is a book term (people from Ecaz planet)",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: scandalized and despising toward the Harkonnens, annoyed.\nThen proud of her and her Mother, determined but casual"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "According to Duncan Idaho, this territory is of the utmost importance to the Fremen – his report mentions a number of sietches in the region. We can assume they're protecting some kind of sacred site.\nIf we could develop relationships with the locals, we might convince them that we alone can protect this place against the Great Houses' appetite.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Ancientsietch_Thufir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\n\n",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, calm, "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Once again, the reports sent by the Harkonnens for years were false. The Fremen in this territory number higher than in all the Baron's estimates! His lack of interest in the desert people puts us in a delicate position, Majesty. It would behoove us to approach the Fremen sietches and negotiate with this people. We need to assess their threat level.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Ancientsietch_Hasimir_1_0",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nFenring specifically says \"Majesty\" and not \"Your Majesty\"",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: despising or annoyed about the Harkonnens' reports as if he was getting used to their incompetence. Tired. Then factual and calm"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "My love, I have a strange feeling.\nOur analytic machines show a large number of Fremen sietches in this area. It seems there are more in this territory than in all the Harkonnens’ estimates…\nCould this land be sacred?\nWe must learn more. Let us make contact with their villages.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: preoccupied, thinking, as she was reading a report. Then she is intrigued",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Ancientsietch_Tessia_1_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I have long suspected the Fremen were hiding something in this territory. The way they always avoid talking about that part of the desert, all those ‘thopters that have mysteriously disappeared, the alleged absence of spice… But who could have guessed it was a sacred sietch?\nOur spies still don't know exactly where it is, but the local tribes surely must. If we gain their trust, someone will eventually let the secret slip.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: casual, even amused, proud. Impressed when saying \"But who could have...\". Then planning and determined",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Ancientsietch_Staban_1_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"props": {},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "AncientSietch_Step1",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Piter",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "I'm pleased to tell you the pain amplifiers worked wonderfully well. We now know why there were so many Fremen in this territory. They were drawn to the presence of one of their underground villages, a very ancient and probably sacred sietch.\nDestroying it would prevent anyone from seeking their support and stifle any impulse to rebel on their part. Then again, we could also protect it from your enemies. The gratitude these people would show you could prove useful indeed.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_H_Ancientsietch_Piter_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Piter de Vries\n\"pain amplifiers\" is a book term\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nSietch is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: casual, torture is normal for him. Destroying the sietch is not moral dilemma just a possibilty"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Sanya",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "This sietch is so vast and ancient… Some sort of Fremen capital perhaps?\nWe could wipe it out, dealing such a blow to the desert people that they wouldn't dare threaten us again. On the other hand, protecting it from our rivals could secure a profitable alliance for the Ecazis.\nThe decision is yours, Mother.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_E_Ancientsietch_Sanya_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Sanya Ecaz\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nSietch is a book and game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: 1§ intrigued, suprised.\nThen : 2§ thinking.\nThen: 3§ determined"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Thufir",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Sire! Our efforts have paid off!\nWe found the location of the Fremen sietch! It's much larger and older than our projections indicated. By protecting it from your rivals, we could secure an alliance with the locals. That said… destroying it is also an option.\nDuncan Idaho admires them, but these are fearsome fighters. Were they to join forces with one of your enemies, it could spell the end of House Atreides.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_A_Ancientsietch_Thufir_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Thufir Hawat\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nSietch is a book and game term\n\n",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: proud, relieved\n2§ Detemined, and serious, planifiying but then, on the last setntece; hesisting\n2§ he would prefer helping the Fremen but cannot exclude the risk"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Fenring",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "We discovered what's been drawing Fremen to this territory, Majesty. There's a site considered sacred to the desert people, a sietch – as they call their villages – which is older and larger than the others.\nIf we help to defend them against your rivals, this unexpected mass of fighters could prove useful. But we could also destroy it. To weaken the Fremen is to weaken their potential allies.",
											"match": {},
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_C_Ancientsietch_Hasimir_1_1",
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Hasimir Fenring\nFremen is a book term (invariable in english but it might vary between language)\nFenring specifically says \"Majesty\" and not \"Your Majesty\"\nsietch is a game and book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: factual, calm. "
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Tessia",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "There was something sacred in this territory. An ancient sietch, no less! The instinct of the Bene Gesserit is quite formidable, isn't it?\nIt falls to you to decide what we should do with this marvel. Destroy it to break the Fremen’s will… or protect it from the Great Houses and make the people of the desert our allies.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Tessia Vernius",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: smiling, proud of herself, joking with her husband. Then, she becomes serious and respectful.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_V_Ancientsietch_Tessia_1_1"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"character": "Staban",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Ancient Sietch!\nLet us take it by storm! After such a show of force, the Fremen will never again dare to put up the slightest resistance! …\nUnless you wish to form an alliance with them? If we swear to defend this sietch from the Great Houses, the Fremen will consider you as one of their own. They will let us harvest the spice wherever we like.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "Speaker is Staban\n\n\"Ancient Sietch\" is a game term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: enthousiastic, ready to fight but then, he tries to appear more reasonnable",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_S_Ancientsietch_Staban_1_1"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"props": {
						"actions": [
							{
								"title": "Raze the Sietch",
								"desc": "",
								"effects": [
									{
										"vals": [
											{
												"val": 1,
												"comment": ""
											}
										],
										"target": {
											"blackboard": "BattleVar"
										},
										"target2": {},
										"ref": "Blackboard_SetVal",
										"displayed": false
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"title": "Ally and protect the Sietch",
								"desc": "",
								"effects": [
									{
										"vals": [
											{
												"val": 2,
												"comment": ""
											}
										],
										"target": {
											"blackboard": "BattleVar"
										},
										"target2": {},
										"ref": "Blackboard_SetVal",
