						]
					},
					"flags": 0
				},
				{
					"id": "DoomedSietch_Start",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Sister, this is a tale that dates back to my great-great-grandfather: Fremen attacking Fremen to steal their water. The <i>Iduali</i>.\nThe people thought they had exterminated them by destroying Sietch Jacurutu, but scouts have found desiccated bodies, abandoned to Shai-Hulud and Old Father Sun… You are our guide today, so you must discover where the Iduali are hiding and kill them off once and for all. None of the Fremen will be safe as long as they live.",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "The Speaker is Stilgar\nIduali is a book term, invariable in english but it might vary per language. It is an insult in the fremen language meaning \"Water Insect\" that is exclusively used againt the Cast Out fremen present in Children of Dune\nSietch Jacurutu is a book term from Children of Dune\nOld Father Sun is a book term",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: telling a sad and terrible story. Despising on \"Iduali\" term (which means \"water insect\". Then, insists that Liet must kill those outcasts.",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Doomsietch_Stilgar_1_0"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "DoomedSietch_Step1",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "The Accursed Sietch!\r\nYou must destroy them, Liet! God and our laws command it. This time, no Iduali must escape alive!\r\nThose pieces of lizard turd will try to scuttle away the minute they sense a threat. Make sure that you surround them, and that all the villages are ready for them!",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "The Speaker is Stilgar\nIduali is a book term, invariable in english but it might vary per language. It is an insult in the fremen language meaning \"Water Insect\" that is exclusively used againt the Cast Out fremen present in Children of Dune\nAccursed Sietch is the in-game name of the sietch in this battle, please use the same name in this text as for the AccursedSietch structure",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: \"Accursed Sietch\" = furious/ almost an insult.\nThen fierce and violent: Idualis must die. ",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Doomsietch_Stilgar_1_1"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
					"from": 0,
					"flags": 0,
					"props": {}
				},
				{
					"id": "DoomedSietch_Step2",
					"speechesPerSpeaker": [
						{
							"character": "Stilgar",
							"pool": [
								{
									"variationIndex": 0,
									"target": 0,
									"speeches": [
										{
											"text": "Look out, sister! The Iduali are trying to flee! None of them must pass! Our Fremen must hold their position!",
											"match": {},
											"translation_notes": "The Speaker is Stilgar\nIduali is a book term, invariable in english but it might vary per language. It is an insult in the fremen language meaning \"Water Insect\" that is exclusively used againt the Cast Out fremen present in Children of Dune",
											"voice_notes": "Tone: determined, aggressive, as if he was seing the Idualis running away",
											"sfx": "Voice_Conquest_F_Doomsietch_Stilgar_1_2"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					],
